{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dustward - Survive the post-apocalyptic ruins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the devastated world, fight mutants, build fortifications, and develop your character in the dynamic survival-action Dustward. Play solo or team up with friends (up to 4 players) in co-op mode to face the dangers of the dead world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engaging campaign and 4-player co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extensive character progression system and unique skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Base building and trap placement capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafting, hunting, and comprehensive survival mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thoughtful dialogues and interesting quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique enemies and unpredictable danger zones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dustward is your personal survival story in a ruthless post-apocalyptic world. Can you endure this nightmare?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727820?t=1746770011","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727820?t=1746770011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727820/e2a116991e79c18cbb9b6af0e6236af077d40ca2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746770011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727820/e2a116991e79c18cbb9b6af0e6236af077d40ca2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746770011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_para